Description: default settings of the G Unity⁷ desktop
 GSettings overrides of the Unity session and Unity Greeter from the
 gentoo-unity7 overlay: the Yaru-dark theme, Ubuntu fonts, Nemo desktop icons,
 window keybindings and power settings, with the default Ubuntu wallpaper.
